1
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:07,370
Oh, you know, Monica's gonna freak if every box isn't labeled.
如果箱子上沒有標籤, 莫妮卡會生氣的

2
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:10,600
You're right, yeah. Okay..
好………

3
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:15,400
"Box of crap."
一箱……垃圾

4
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:21,210
It's so wild. When Monica and Chandler come back, they are gonna have a baby.
莫妮卡和錢德回來時會帶個孩子 

5
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,940
-A baby! -I know.
-一個孩子！ -我知道

6
