I don't know. Rachel's still there yelling at him.
我不知道 瑞秋還在這衝他喊

9
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,180
Poor guy. I would not wanna be him right now.
可憐的傢伙.我現在可真不想成為他啊

10
