Okay. All right, what room did the nurse say Erica was in?
剛才說艾瑞卡在哪兒？

18
00:01:52,310 --> 00:01:54,300
-702. -Okay.
-702. -哦

19
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,610
-Come on, baby. -Come on. You can do this.
-來吧, 寶貝 -來吧, 你能行

20
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:00,980
Get this damn thing out of me!
快把那個鬼東西從我裡面弄出來！

21
00:02:04,550 --> 00:02:06,110
Well, these are for you.
這是給你們的

22
