Go back to sleep. I have to go home.
接著睡吧, 我該回家了

34
00:03:02,010 --> 00:03:05,610
Oh, God. This was amazing.
真是太棒了

35
00:03:06,510 --> 00:03:08,610
It really was.
的確是太棒了

36
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,720
You've learned some new moves.
你學了不少新招兒嘛

37
