-別把我們倆丟在一起啊 -說什麼？

47
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:52,720
This is exactly the kind of social situation..
這是個很重要的場合

48
00:03:52,890 --> 00:03:54,790
that I am not comfortable with.
我最怕的就是這種場合了

49
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:59,100
What kind of social situation are you comfortable with?
什麼樣的場合你不怕啊！

50
00:03:59,930 --> 00:04:03,560
It's just that we've never spent any time, you know, alone together.
我和她從來沒單獨待在一起過

51
00:04:03,770 --> 00:04:07,230
You'll be fine. You won't, but I'll be back in two minutes.
沒事的……才怪 不過我馬上就回來了

52
00:04:07,410 --> 00:04:09,040
Okay.
哦

53
00:04:15,820 --> 00:04:20,650
So any plans for the summer?
那個……夏天有什麼打算？

54
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,760
I don't know. Maybe church camp.
不清楚, 可能參加個教會野營吧

55
