-Come in. -Morning.
-進來 -早啊

64
00:05:16,910 --> 00:05:18,640
-Hey. -What's that?
-嗨！ -什麼呀？！

65
00:05:18,810 --> 00:05:22,340
Oh, it's my housewarming present for Monica and Chandler.
送莫妮卡和錢德的喬遷禮

66
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:25,790
That's a baby chick and duck.
剛出生的小雞和小鴨！

67
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:28,850
And I named them Chick Jr. and Duck Jr.
我給它倆取名叫小小雞和小小鴨

68
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:32,120
I did not see that coming.
真的是沒想到哈

69
00:05:32,330 --> 00:05:35,230
They'll love it at that new house. It has that big backyard.
那麼大個後院它倆肯定會喜歡的

70
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:37,520
When they're old, they'll go to that farm..
以後要是老了的話 錢德可以和上次一樣把它們送到..

71
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:40,570
that Chandler took the other chick and duck to.
上次那個農場去

72
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:43,330
-Yes. -Yeah.
-沒錯 -是啊

73
00:05:43,540 --> 00:05:47,670
