-睡得怎樣？ -很好很好, 你呢？

102
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:38,740
-Good. -I'll bet you did.
-不錯 -那還用說

103
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:42,450
Would you guys mind giving us a minute?
啊……能讓我倆單獨待會兒嗎？

104
00:07:42,660 --> 00:07:44,890
Sure. Just keep an eye on the chick and duck.
好, 幫忙看著點小雞和小鴨

105
00:07:45,130 --> 00:07:47,060
Chick and the duck? Didn't they die..?
小雞和小鴨？不是已經死……

106
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:53,500
Dive. Yeah, they dove. Headfirst into fun on the farm.
死活非要去農場哦

107
00:08:00,510 --> 00:08:01,980
So..
所以..  

108
00:08:04,050 --> 00:08:07,910
-Morning. -You too.
-早啊 -你也是啊

109
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:11,920
-Last night was just wonderful. -Oh, it really was.
-昨晚太棒了 -真的是

110
00:08:12,090 --> 00:08:14,280
I woke up today with the biggest smile.
-我今天醒來滿臉都是笑容

111
00:08:14,490 --> 00:08:16,510
I know, me too. It was..
-我也是啊

112
00:08:16,690 --> 00:08:20,420
You know, it was one of those things you think is never going to happen.
就像……有些事情覺得從來不可能

113
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:24,360
And then it does, and it's everything you want it to be.
但有一天真的發生了 而且是自己所希望的那樣

114
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:27,160
I know. It was just..
我知道, 實在是……

115
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:31,740
It's just the perfect way to say goodbye.
實在是最好的告別方式了

116
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:43,070
-Just a little bit more, honey. -Oh, man, this hurts!
-再努力一點！ -疼死我了！

117
00:08:43,250 --> 00:08:45,080
Is it really that bad?
真疼得那麼厲害？

118
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:49,220
I think it's time to kick you in the nuts and see which is worse.
啊哈！現在該踢你老二了, 看看哪個更疼！

119
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:53,690
The baby's head is crowning.
嬰兒的頭已經要出來了

120
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:58,460
Oh, my God! That is the most beautiful top of a head I have ever seen.
天哪！我所見過的最美麗的頭頂了！

