You don't want to miss this. This is the birth of your child.
錢德！絕不能錯過的！ 你孩子出生了！ 

123
00:09:06,340 --> 00:09:09,830
-It's the miracle of life. -All right.
-生命的奇跡啊！ -好吧

124
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:15,280
Wow, that is one disgusting miracle.
哇！這麼噁心的奇跡！

125
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:18,050
Start pushing. Here we go.
開始往外擠

126
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:20,350
Here come the shoulders.
好！肩膀出來了！

127
00:09:26,730 --> 00:09:29,160
It's a boy.
是個男孩！

128
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:32,090
-Is he okay? -He's just fine.
-他不要緊吧？！ -不要緊的

129
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:34,100
You did it.
你成功了！

130
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:35,900
It's a baby.
嬰兒！ 

131
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:41,870
A beautiful little baby. And some other stuff I'm gonna pretend I don't see.
美麗的小嬰兒！ 還有點其他東西我就裝沒看見吧！

132
00:09:43,780 --> 00:09:46,370
-Would you like to cut the umbilical cord? -Okay.
-準備好切臍帶了嗎？ -好了

133
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:52,620
Well, that's spongy.
居然還一跳一跳的！

134
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:59,160
Hey, handsome.
嘿！我的寶貝兒, 

135
00:09:59,990 --> 00:10:05,190
I'll love you so much that no woman is ever gonna be good enough for you.
我愛死你了！誰家的女孩兒都配不上你！

136
00:10:07,340 --> 00:10:10,000
-We are so lucky. -I know.
-咱們太幸運了！ -是啊

137
00:10:10,970 --> 00:10:13,340
He has your eyes.
他眼睛和你的一樣

138
00:10:14,940 --> 00:10:18,400
I mean, I know that's not possible, but he does.
雖然不可能, 不過真的是

139
00:10:18,610 --> 00:10:21,140
We'll just get him cleaned up a bit.
把他擦乾淨些

140
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:25,790
Oh, my God, he's beautiful.
真是太美了

141
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:30,020
-Thank you so much. -I'm really happy for you guys.
-多謝你啊 -太為你們倆高興了

142
00:10:30,420 --> 00:10:33,550
-How do you feel? -I'm tired.
-現在感覺如何？ -累啊

143
00:10:33,730 --> 00:10:38,530
You don't have that much time to relax. The other one will be along in a minute.
沒多少時間可歇了, 下一個馬上就出來 

144
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:46,970
I'm sorry, who should be along in a what, now?
抱歉……誰要出來？剛才你說啥？！

145
00:10:48,740 --> 00:10:51,230
The next baby should be along in a minute.
下一個孩子馬上就出來

146
00:10:51,450 --> 00:10:54,210
We only ordered one.
我們只訂了一個！

147
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:58,210
-You know it's twins, right? -Oh, yeah.
-你們知道是雙胞胎吧？ -才怪

148
00:10:58,390 --> 00:11:01,840
These are the faces of two people in the know.
知道我們倆還能這副表情！

149
00:11:02,690 --> 00:11:06,820
I can't believe you didn't know it's twins. This has never happened before.
怎麼可能不知道是雙胞胎？ 以前從來沒有過的

150
00:11:07,030 --> 00:11:10,760
Well, gosh. That makes me feel so special and good.
啊！我現在感覺還真特別真爽啊

151
00:11:10,970 --> 00:11:12,430
Did you know it was twins?
等等, 你知道是雙胞胎？

152
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:15,160
It's here in the paperwork we got from the clinic.
是啊, 俄亥俄送過來的文件裡面寫著呢

153
00:11:15,570 --> 00:11:18,440
-Did anybody tell you? -I don't think so.
-有人告訴過你嗎？ -沒有啊

154
00:11:18,610 --> 00:11:23,670
They did mention two heartbeats, but I thought it was just mine and the baby's.
不過確實提到了兩種心跳 我當時覺得應該就是我和孩子的吧

155
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,710
They said, "Both heartbeats are strong."
他們就一直說兩個心跳都很強

156
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:29,280
And I thought, "Well, that's good, because I'm having a baby."
我就覺得不錯啊, 因為我正懷著孩子哪

157
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:33,680
-This is unbelievable. -Twins actually run in my family.
-太難以置信了 -我家有雙胞胎的傳統的

158
00:11:33,890 --> 00:11:35,580
Interesting.
真有意思哈

