161
00:11:43,930 --> 00:11:45,460
Twins!
雙胞胎！ 

162
00:11:45,630 --> 00:11:47,530
Twins!
雙胞胎！

163
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:52,000
-Chandler, you're panicking. -Join me, won't you?
-錢德！你在發抖 -沒錯！和我一起抖吧！

164
00:11:53,140 --> 00:11:57,300
What do you say we keep one and then just have an option on the other one?
我們留一個, 另一個給別人如何?

165
