大團圓！ 到那時候大家該多開心啊

169
00:12:12,430 --> 00:12:15,520
What if the person who adopts the other one is horrible?
如果領養另一個人的是壞蛋呢？

170
00:12:15,730 --> 00:12:18,670
What if they're not? What if it's adopted by a king?
要不是呢？要是被某國王領養了呢？

171
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:22,230
Yeah. Because I hear the king is looking to adopt.
是哈, 聽說國王要領養個孩子！

172
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:25,460
Monica, we are not ready to have two babies.
莫妮卡, 咱倆沒想好要兩個孩子的

173
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:29,010
That doesn't matter. We have waited so long for this.
又有什麼關係！ 咱們等了這麼久

174
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:32,410
I don't care if it's two babies. I don't care if it's three babies.
我才不管是一個孩子還是兩個孩子！ 仨孩子都沒關係！

175
00:12:32,580 --> 00:12:36,310
I don't care if the entire cast of Eight Is Enough comes out of there.
生出《八寶喜事》全劇組來都沒關係！

176
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:41,320
We are taking them home because they are our children.
一定要把他們帶回家 因為他們是咱們的孩子啊 

177
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:43,490
Okay.
好吧

178
00:12:45,460 --> 00:12:46,760
-Okay. -Okay!
-好 -好

179
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,760
Okay.
好了

180
00:12:49,300 --> 00:12:52,030
It looks like we're about ready over here. Come on, Erica.
看來我們這裡準備好了! 來吧, 艾瑞卡.

181
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,290
Start pushing again now.
現在, 再推一次吧

182
00:12:55,770 --> 00:12:59,370
-Here she comes. -She? It's a girl?
-女嬰也出來了！ -女嬰？！是個女孩？！

183
00:12:59,610 --> 00:13:01,170
Yeah.
對

184
00:13:02,710 --> 00:13:04,640
Well, now we have one of each.
現在一男一女了！

185
00:13:06,110 --> 00:13:08,840
And that's enough.
然後就別再生了！

186
00:13:11,450 --> 00:13:15,080
And then she said it was the perfect way to say goodbye.
後來她說那個是最好的告別方式

187
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:18,790
Oh, my God. What did you say?
天哪, 你說什麼了？

188
00:13:18,990 --> 00:13:23,450
-Nothing. What do you say to that? -You've got to tell her how you feel.
-什麼都沒說 能說什麼啊？ -羅斯！一定要告訴她你的感受啊！

189
00:13:23,660 --> 00:13:26,060
-No way. -Well, you can't just give up.
-不行！ -不能就這麼放棄她啊！

190
00:13:26,230 --> 00:13:28,600
Is that what a dinosaur would do?
恐龍會這麼做嗎？

191
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:33,910
-What? -I'm just trying to speak your language.
-啥？ -我就是想用你們的語言和你說來著

192
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:37,170
Ross, Rachel doesn't know that you even wanna get back together.
瑞秋不知道你想復合 

193
00:13:37,340 --> 00:13:41,410
