-瑞秋？ -嗯？

206
00:14:33,530 --> 00:14:40,170
I know you're leaving tonight, but I just have to tell you.
我知道你今晚就走了 我就是想告訴你……

207
00:14:40,810 --> 00:14:43,040
I love you.
我愛你

208
