Now, I don't know if that changes your plans at all.
不知道你的計劃會不會因此改變……

209
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:52,740
But I thought you should know.
不過我覺得還是應該告訴你

210
00:14:53,890 --> 00:14:56,050
Gunther.
甘瑟！ 

211
00:14:57,960 --> 00:15:02,620
I love you too. Probably not in the same way.
我也愛你 不過和你愛我含義應該不一樣

212
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:08,060
But I do. And when I'm in a cafe having coffee..
但我真的愛你 每次我在咖啡屋喝咖啡

213
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:11,730
or I see a man with hair brighter than the sun..
或者看見誰的頭髮比太陽還亮

214
00:15:13,070 --> 00:15:15,300
I'll think of you.
我都會想起你

215
00:15:21,650 --> 00:15:24,080
-Bye, you guys. -Bye.
