216
00:15:27,090 --> 00:15:29,720
Oh, my God!
天哪！

217
00:15:29,920 --> 00:15:32,290
Unbelievable.
難以置信啊

218
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:36,120
-Hey, you know what might help? -I'm not getting you a muffin!
-我有個好主意…… -我不會給你拿鬆餅的！

