259
00:18:20,590 --> 00:18:24,390
-Oh, my God, you did that yourself? -Honey, that's gorgeous.
-哇！你自己一個人弄的？ -這也太漂亮了吧 老公！

260
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:28,030
You know, the baby can't read, Mike.
嬰兒又不識字, 麥克！

261
