00:18:39,950 --> 00:18:43,610
-Apparently, there's some big surprise. -Yeah, did she sound happy about it?
-而且好像還要有個驚喜？ -她聽起來口氣高不高興？

265
00:18:43,780 --> 00:18:47,810
Because my friend Ethel's baby was born with a teeny-tiny beard.
我有個朋友的孩子剛出生就有點鬍子

266
00:18:52,330 --> 00:18:56,390
-Welcome home. -Oh, my God.
-歡迎回家！ -天哪！

267
00:18:57,460 --> 00:19:00,260
-Oh, my gosh. -Hey.
-天哪！ -嘿

268
00:19:00,470 --> 00:19:02,490
Hey.
嘿

269
00:19:04,910 --> 00:19:07,770
Hey, so, what is the big surprise?
你說的驚喜是什麼啊？

270
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:14,610
-Oh, my God! -How did this..?
-天哪！ -這個問題  

