00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:04,850
Neither will I.
我也不會

299
00:21:12,930 --> 00:21:14,920
All right. Now I really have to go.
現在真的要走了

300
00:21:15,100 --> 00:21:18,590
Okay, au revoir.
Au revoir！（法語「再見」）

301
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:22,430
They're gonna really hate me over there.
啊……等在巴黎我一定恨死自己了

302
00:21:24,780 --> 00:21:27,610
So you just let her go?
你就這麼讓她走了？

303
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:29,610
Yeah.
嗯

304
00:21:30,650 --> 00:21:33,420
-Hey, maybe that's for the best. -Yeah?
-這樣也許是最好的了 -真的？

305
00:21:33,590 --> 00:21:36,650
Yeah. You know, you just.. Look, you gotta..
真的, 關於昨晚... 

306
00:21:36,860 --> 00:21:39,420
You gotta think about last night the way she does.
她怎麼想你也應該怎麼想

307
00:21:39,590 --> 00:21:41,860
Okay? You know, maybe..
也許……

308
00:21:42,860 --> 00:21:46,560
Maybe sleeping together was the perfect way to say goodbye.
也許在一起過夜 就是最好的告別了

309
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:50,470
They slept together?
他們一起睡覺了？

310
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:52,500
I was with you.
我和你一起的

311
00:21:54,340 --> 00:21:58,570
-Now she'll never know how he feels. -Maybe that's okay, you know?
-可是這樣一來她就不知道他的感受了啊 -也許沒關係的 

312
00:21:58,750 --> 00:22:00,910
Maybe it is better this way.
也許這樣更好 

313
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:05,210
I mean, now.. Now you can move on.
現在……現在你可以向前繼續生活了

314
00:22:05,420 --> 00:22:08,050
I mean, you've been trying to for so long.
你已經努力適應這麼久了

315
00:22:08,260 --> 00:22:11,090
Maybe now that you're on different continents..
現在你們倆身在不同的大陸……

316
00:22:11,260 --> 00:22:12,890
-Right? -Yeah.
-是吧？ -是啊

317
00:22:16,930 --> 00:22:20,370
Maybe now you can actually do it, you know.
也許你現在終於可以解脫了

318
00:22:21,370 --> 00:22:23,770
You can finally get over her.
終於可以不再想她了

319
00:22:27,770 --> 00:22:30,040
Yeah, that's true.
的確是這樣沒錯

320
00:22:31,280 --> 00:22:32,800
Except..
可是……

321
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:37,750
-I don't want to get over her. -What?
-我不願意就這樣解脫 -什麼？

322
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:40,910
-I don't. I want to be with her. -Really?
-我不想……我想和她在一起 -真的？

323
00:22:41,120 --> 00:22:43,590
-Yeah. I'm going to go after her. -Yeah, you are!
-嗯, 我去追她 -去吧！

324
00:22:45,490 --> 00:22:48,260
Wait! Wait! Get your coat! Get your coat!
穿上外衣！穿上外衣！

325
00:22:48,460 --> 00:22:50,430
-My coat. -This is so cool!
-外衣…… -太酷了！

326
00:22:50,630 --> 00:22:53,720
I have no idea what's going on, but I am excited!
雖然一點都不明白咋回事  不過我現在太興奮了！

327
00:22:53,930 --> 00:22:56,430
-What do you think she's gonna say? -I don't know.
-羅斯！你覺得她會怎麼說？ -不知道！ 

328
00:22:56,600 --> 00:23:01,170
Even if she shoots me down, at least I won't spend my life wondering..
不過即便她拒絕我 我也不會餘生都活在猜測之中

329
00:23:01,340 --> 00:23:03,940
what would have happened. Where is my coat?
我外衣哪兒去了！

330
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:08,440
You didn't bring one! My cab's downstairs. I'll drive you to the airport.
你根本就沒穿來！ 我車就在下面, 開車送你去機場！

331
00:23:08,650 --> 00:23:09,980
-Wish me luck. -Hurry!
-大伙祝我好運！ -快！！！！！

332
00:23:10,150 --> 00:23:11,710
Good luck!
祝你好運

333
00:23:16,090 --> 00:23:17,520
Oh, my God.
天 

334
00:23:17,690 --> 00:23:20,660
Ross is going after Rachel. And you guys have babies.
羅斯去追瑞秋, 你們有了孩子

335
00:23:20,830 --> 00:23:22,950
This is, like, the best day ever!
這就像是最棒的一天！

336
00:23:23,600 --> 00:23:27,590
Why is there an ass-shaped paint stain on my couch?
我沙發上怎麼有屁股形狀的東西？

337
00:23:30,740 --> 00:23:32,760
She asked you a question, Mike.
是你的問題, 麥克！

338
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:43,150
You really think we'll make it in time?
你真覺得我們能及時趕到?

339
00:23:43,320 --> 00:23:46,440
Hey, I didn't have my license taken away because I drive carefully.
嘿, 我的駕照還沒被吊銷, 因為我開車很小心

340
00:23:51,120 --> 00:23:54,120
-There's no seat belts! -That's okay. If we hit anything..
-沒安全帶？ -沒關係 一旦車撞到什麼東西...

341
00:23:54,290 --> 00:23:59,390
the engine will explode, so it's better if you're thrown from the car.
引擎就會爆炸  相比之下還是被甩出去比較好

342
00:23:59,630 --> 00:24:02,630
-All right, all right. Let's do this. -Okay!
-好！我們上！ -好!

343
00:24:04,040 --> 00:24:05,660
-Hey! -80th and East End.
-嘿 -東區80號

344
00:24:05,870 --> 00:24:09,170
-No. I don't take passengers. -The law makes you accept any fare.
-我不載客 -法律規定逢客必載的！

345
00:24:09,380 --> 00:24:11,400
You don't understand. This cab isn't real.
你不明白, 這車本來就不是計程車！

346
00:24:11,650 --> 00:24:13,510
What's your medallion number?
等我去投訴你, 你牌照號多少

347
00:24:13,710 --> 00:24:16,050
My medallion number is, get out of the cab!
號碼是：滾出車去！

348
00:24:16,580 --> 00:24:20,540
-What? -Get out of the cab!
-什麼？ -滾出車去！滾出車去！

349
00:24:30,260 --> 00:24:31,890
Hey, you guys. Check this out.
嘿！大家看

350
00:24:36,470 --> 00:24:38,770
-No! -Okay.
-不! -好

351
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:45,230
Oh, hey, can I give you guys my housewarming gift now?
哦！現在給你們喬遷禮怎麼樣？

352
00:24:45,450 --> 00:24:48,510
-Now, that you can do. -All right.
-可以呀 -好

353
00:24:49,450 --> 00:24:50,810
I have a question.
問個問題 

354
00:24:50,980 --> 00:24:54,320
Without looking under their diapers, can you tell them apart?
如果不看下面你能分清他們嗎？

355
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:57,950
Of course I can, I'm their mother.
當然可以, 我是媽媽啊

356
00:24:58,120 --> 00:25:01,620
Oh, yeah? Okay. Which one is that one?
好, 那個是誰？

357
00:25:01,860 --> 00:25:03,120
That's Jack.
是傑克

358
00:25:08,900 --> 00:25:12,070
Jack's gonna have a tough time in high school with that vagina.
哇！傑克要去詹妮的學校了

359
00:25:21,980 --> 00:25:26,350
Chick Jr.? Duck Jr.?
小小雞？小小鴨？

360
00:25:27,820 --> 00:25:30,690
Don't hide from Mama!
別和媽媽捉迷藏！！

361
00:25:38,970 --> 00:25:40,300
You can open your eyes now.
現在可以睜開眼睛了

362
00:25:40,470 --> 00:25:42,900
-Are we off the bridge? -Yes!
-下橋了嗎？ -下了！

363
00:25:43,100 --> 00:25:48,630
-Is the woman on the bicycle still alive? -Yeah, she jumped right back up.
-自行車上的老太太還活著嗎？ -活著！她及時跳開了！

364
00:25:49,140 --> 00:25:53,040
-Oh, my God. Phoebe, slow down! -Do you want to get to Rachel in time?
-天哪！菲比！開慢點！ -你到底想不想及時追上瑞秋！

365
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:55,410
Yes, but I don't want to die in your cab.
想！不過我不想死在你車裡！

366
00:25:55,620 --> 00:25:59,140
You should have thought of that before you got in!
上車之前你怎麼不想清楚！！！

367
00:25:59,550 --> 00:26:01,180
-Tollbooth. -What?
-收費站 -什麼？

368
00:26:01,420 --> 00:26:03,650
Tollbooth!
收費站!

369
00:26:03,860 --> 00:26:06,550
Four bucks. There are quarters in the glove compartment.
四塊錢, 雜物箱裡有零錢

370
00:26:08,860 --> 00:26:10,560
Hurry!
快點！！！！！！

371
00:26:11,500 --> 00:26:14,520
Okay.
哦

372
00:26:14,730 --> 00:26:17,000
Damn, that window's clean.
媽的, 窗戶怎麼這麼乾淨！

373
00:26:33,890 --> 00:26:36,450
We were wondering what was taking so long..
我們還說你拿禮物這麼半天還不回來

374
00:26:36,660 --> 00:26:39,850
but now we understand. You were doing this.
現在才知道你在幹這個……

375
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:45,160
Okay. I wanted to surprise you, but..
我本想給你們個驚喜的……

376
00:26:45,330 --> 00:26:49,600
For your housewarming gift, I got you a baby chick and a baby duck.
作為喬遷禮, 送給你們一隻小雞一隻小鴨！

377
00:26:50,100 --> 00:26:52,400
Really? You got us a chick and a duck?
真的？給我們小雞小鴨？

378
00:26:52,570 --> 00:26:58,100
Oh, great. Just what you want for a new house with infants. Bird feces!
太好了, 家裡有嬰兒, 鳥糞正合適啊！

379
00:26:58,280 --> 00:27:00,940
But they must've jumped off the table. Now they're gone!
一定是從桌子上跳下去了, 現在都不見了啊！

380
00:27:01,110 --> 00:27:02,580
Don't worry, we'll find them.
別著急, 慢慢找

381
00:27:02,780 --> 00:27:05,220
Actually, I'm gonna go check on the twins.
我去看孩子去了

382
00:27:05,390 --> 00:27:08,510
Oh, God! What did I just step on?
啊!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! 我剛才踩著什麼了！

383
00:27:08,990 --> 00:27:11,620
It's okay. It's just an egg roll.
沒事了, 就是個蛋卷

384
00:27:11,860 --> 00:27:15,060
You stepped on my egg roll?!
你竟敢踩著我的蛋卷！

385
00:27:15,260 --> 00:27:18,420
I'm sorry. I didn't know to look for Chinese food on the floor.
抱歉, 誰會想到地上會有中國菜！

386
00:27:18,630 --> 00:27:20,220
Just put it on a plate and leave.
放到盤子裡, 然後快走

387
00:27:24,400 --> 00:27:27,930
-Okay. Let's find these birds. -All right.
-好了. 開始找吧 -好

388
00:27:30,740 --> 00:27:33,740
Wait, wait. You hear that?
等等！聽到了沒？ 

389
00:27:36,220 --> 00:27:40,550
-They're in the table! -Well, that can't be good.
-啊！在桌子裡！ -這可不妙了！

390
00:27:40,720 --> 00:27:42,710
-We gotta get them out of there! -How?
-必須要取出來！ -怎麼取？！

391
00:27:42,920 --> 00:27:45,580
Maybe we can lure them out. You know any birdcalls?
也許能引誘他們出來, 你知道鳥怎麼叫嗎？

392
00:27:45,790 --> 00:27:48,450
Oh, tons. I'm quite the woodsman.
當然了, 我就是干伐木工的

393
00:27:49,660 --> 00:27:52,930
Well, maybe we can just tip the table a little.
把桌子一頭抬起來點也許管用

394
00:27:53,130 --> 00:27:55,930
Joey, wait! The ball!
喬伊等一下！球還沒...

395
00:28:11,990 --> 00:28:13,320
So, what do we do?
現在怎麼辦！！

396
00:28:13,490 --> 00:28:15,450
Maybe we can open this up somehow.
不清楚……也許邊上什麼地方能打開吧

397
00:28:15,620 --> 00:28:17,250
Okay.
好

398
00:28:18,930 --> 00:28:22,090
No. It's all glued together.
不行啊, 都粘上了

399
00:28:22,300 --> 00:28:25,290
Does that mean we have to bust it open?
也就是說要……硬撬開？

400
00:28:25,500 --> 00:28:29,260
-I don't know. Maybe. -Oh, my God.
-不知道……也許吧 -天哪！

401
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:34,930
I know. It's.. It's the foosball table.
我明白……這可是足球桌啊

402
00:28:36,110 --> 00:28:38,440
All right, you know what? We don't have a choice.
沒有辦法了 

403
00:28:38,610 --> 00:28:43,550
It's like I would have said in that sci-fi movie if I'd have gotten the part.
就像我在一部科幻電影裡面的台詞一樣, 如果我當初贏到角色的話……

404
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:46,880
Those are our men in there, and we have to get them out..
「裡面有人！必須要救出來！」

405
00:28:47,620 --> 00:28:51,060
even if I have to sacrifice the most important thing in my life..
「即使要犧牲我生命中最重要的東西--

406
00:28:51,220 --> 00:28:54,630
my time machine.
我的時間機器……」

407
00:28:54,790 --> 00:28:57,660
-Did that movie ever get made? -It did not.
-這電影拍出來了沒？ -根本沒拍……

408
00:29:01,870 --> 00:29:04,670
Jack Weinberg, white courtesy phone. Jack Weinberg.

409
00:29:04,840 --> 00:29:07,170
-Ross, where are you going? -To talk to Rachel.
-羅斯！你去哪裡？ -去找瑞秋啊 

410
00:29:07,340 --> 00:29:10,000
Isn't that why we took a ride in the death cab?
所以我才坐死亡計程車來的

411
00:29:10,210 --> 00:29:12,010
You're walking up to her at the gate?
你就直接去登機口？ 

412
00:29:12,180 --> 00:29:14,840
Have you never chased anyone through the airport before?
以前在沒在機場追過人？！

413
00:29:15,050 --> 00:29:17,350
Not since my cop show got canceled.
我的警察戲鏡頭被取消之後就沒有過了……

414
00:29:18,420 --> 00:29:20,850
You have to get a ticket to get past security.
必須先買票才能通過安檢

415
00:29:21,050 --> 00:29:25,010
-What? We're never gonna make it. -Not with that attitude. Now, haul ass!
-那就趕不及了啊！ -保持這種氣勢！快滾過來！

416
00:29:27,430 --> 00:29:31,730
Okay, if you could all walk slower, that'd be great.
大家再走慢點就好了

417
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:41,770
-Madame, your passport, please. -Oh, my God.
-（法式英語）小姐, 看一下您的護照？ -天哪！ 

418
00:29:41,940 --> 00:29:44,670
I was afraid I wouldn't remember my high school French.
我還害怕高中學的法語都忘乾淨了呢！

419
00:29:44,840 --> 00:29:47,680
But I understood every word you just said.
你剛才說的每個字我都聽明白了！

420
00:29:48,350 --> 00:29:51,680
-Your boarding pass, please. -Oh, sure.
-您的登機牌？ -哦, 當然

421
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:57,450
Shoot, I had it. Oh, I can't believe this.
好的……找不到…… 本來在啊……真叫人……

422
00:29:57,860 --> 00:30:00,590
-Madame, if you don't have your.. -I have it, I have it!
-小姐, 如果您沒有…… -我有我有我有我有！！！

423
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:08,130
Okay, I can't find it, but I remember that I was in seat 32C..
哎呀, 找不到, 不過我清楚記得 我的座位號是32 C 

424
00:30:08,300 --> 00:30:10,930
because that's my bra size.
因為我罩杯號就是這個 

425
00:30:11,810 --> 00:30:13,530
You must have your boarding pass..
-小姐, 您必須要有登機牌, 否則……

426
00:30:13,740 --> 00:30:17,110
You know what? If I was in 36D, we would not be having this problem.
告訴你, 我要是36 D, 就沒這麼多麻煩了！

427
00:30:24,950 --> 00:30:27,420
-Hi. I need a ticket. -Just one?
-您好, 我要買一張票 -就買一張？

428
00:30:27,620 --> 00:30:30,420
I drive you here, and I don't get to see how it works out?
我開車這麼大老遠送你過來 不能看看結局啥樣？

429
00:30:30,620 --> 00:30:35,930
-Fine. Two tickets. I need two tickets. -We're on our honeymoon.
-好吧, 兩張, 我買兩張票！ -我們在度蜜月呢

430
00:30:36,560 --> 00:30:39,790
-And the destination? -I don't care. Whatever's the cheapest.
-目的地是？ -隨便, 最便宜的吧

431
00:30:40,330 --> 00:30:42,300
I'm so lucky I married you.
我嫁給你真是太走運了哈

432
00:30:44,570 --> 00:30:48,630
Oh, shoot. Damn it. Where is it?
啊！靠！媽的！哪裡去了！

433
00:30:49,580 --> 00:30:52,910
I found it. I found it. I told you I would find it.
啊！找到了找到了！哈！ 找到了！早和你說了我有！

434
00:30:53,080 --> 00:30:56,640
In your face. You're a different person.
你是另外一個人了..

435
00:30:56,850 --> 00:30:58,720
Sorry.
抱歉

436
00:30:59,120 --> 00:31:03,080
Okay. Flight 421, Paris.
4-21航班, 巴黎 

437
00:31:03,790 --> 00:31:06,280
-I don't see it. Do you see it? -No. Did we miss it?
-找不到, 你呢？ -我也找不著 錯過了？

438
00:31:06,460 --> 00:31:09,790
No, no, it's impossible. It doesn't leave for another 20 minutes.
不可能,20分鐘後才起飛的

439
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:12,520
Maybe we have the flight number wrong.
航班號錯了吧

440
00:31:12,730 --> 00:31:14,670
God.
天

441
00:31:16,940 --> 00:31:18,630
-Hello. -Hey, it's me. Here's Ross.
-嗨 -嗨, 是我, 給你羅斯

442
00:31:18,810 --> 00:31:21,100
What?
什麼？

443
00:31:21,270 --> 00:31:22,610
Hey. Hey, listen..
嗨！聽著……

444
00:31:22,810 --> 00:31:26,970
You wouldn't believe the cute noises the twins are making. Wait, listen.
天啊, 倆孩子的聲音太可愛了！羅斯你聽！

445
00:31:27,180 --> 00:31:29,380
But Monica..
但是莫妮卡  

446
00:31:29,550 --> 00:31:33,950
Monica. Monica. Monica.
莫妮卡？……莫妮卡！莫妮卡！莫妮卡！莫妮卡!

447
00:31:34,890 --> 00:31:36,690
I'm sorry. They were doing it before.
抱歉, 他倆剛才還出聲來著啊

448
00:31:36,890 --> 00:31:40,330
-That's all right. Listen, listen. -Oh, wait, wait. Here they go again.
-莫妮卡！聽著…… -等等！又來了！！

449
00:31:40,490 --> 00:31:44,450
Monica. Monica. Monica.
莫妮卡！莫妮卡！莫妮卡！莫妮卡！莫妮卡！

450
00:31:44,800 --> 00:31:46,360
-Monica? -Isn't that cute?
-莫妮卡？ -可愛吧！

451
00:31:46,570 --> 00:31:49,500
That is precious! Listen..
可愛死了！！！聽著

452
00:31:49,670 --> 00:31:52,970
-I need Rachel's flight information. -Oh, okay.
-我要瑞秋的航班信息 -哦, 好

453
00:31:53,410 --> 00:31:58,900
-All right, it's flight 421. Leaves at 8:40. -I have that. It's not on the board.
-4-21航班,8點40起飛  -是啊, 就是這個, 看板上找不到

454
00:31:59,080 --> 00:32:03,280
That's what it says here. Flight 421. Leaves at 8:40. Newark Airport.
這裡就是這樣寫的啊,4-21航班  8點40起飛, 紐瓦克機場

455
00:32:03,480 --> 00:32:05,780
-What? -Newark Airport.
-什麼？ -紐瓦克機場 

456
00:32:05,990 --> 00:32:10,420
-Why? Where are you? -JFK.
-怎麼了？你們在哪裡？ -肯尼迪機場……

457
00:32:39,020 --> 00:32:42,580
Don't worry, you guys! We're gonna get you out of there!
別著急！會把你們救出來的！

458
00:32:43,590 --> 00:32:47,290
And we're also gonna buy you tiny bird hearing aids.
然後再給你們買小鳥用助聽器……

459
00:32:53,030 --> 00:32:56,370
Okay. Here goes.
好, 來了……

460
00:33:01,070 --> 00:33:02,740
What's the matter?
怎麼了？

461
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:06,880
I need to say goodbye to the table first.
我要先跟桌子告別

462
00:33:08,410 --> 00:33:10,250
I understand.
我理解

463
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:12,580
Okay.
好

464
00:33:16,190 --> 00:33:18,620
Table..
桌子！

