00:33:20,390 --> 00:33:23,920
you have given us so many great times.
你曾經給予我們太多的歡樂時光

466
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:31,830
And you guys, Jordan, Victor, Joel..
你們大伙……喬丹、維克多, 還有喬

467
00:33:32,270 --> 00:33:35,710
All of you guys. What can I say?
你們所有人, 我得說

468
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:41,400
You guys make us look good.
是你們讓我倆更有形象

469
00:33:44,650 --> 00:33:47,710
-You want to say anything? -I don't know.
-你想說什麼？ -不清楚……

470
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:53,620
Except that, for one last time..
不過, 最後一次……

471
00:33:54,090 --> 00:33:58,120
Good game. Good game. Good game.
幹得好……幹得好……幹得好……幹得好……

472
00:34:00,770 --> 00:34:02,390
Good game.
幹得好

473
00:34:05,870 --> 00:34:07,860
Okay. Here we go.
好吧, 來, 動手

474
00:34:15,980 --> 00:34:17,970
I can't do it.
我下不了手

475
