Well, I can't do it either.
我也下不了手啊！

476
00:34:21,620 --> 00:34:24,610
-Hey. Did you find them? -Yeah. They're stuck inside the table.
-找到沒？ -在桌子裡面哪！

477
00:34:24,790 --> 00:34:27,490
And we have to bust it open, but neither of us can do it.
必須要撬開, 不過我們倆都下不去手！

478
00:34:27,660 --> 00:34:32,890
Oh, well, sure. It's got to be so hard.
是啊……太難了……

479
00:34:33,100 --> 00:34:35,800
I'll do it. Give me.
我來吧, 給我！

480
00:34:40,010 --> 00:34:41,840
Phoebe!
菲比！！！ 

481
00:34:42,040 --> 00:34:44,100
No, no, no!
不要啊！！！！！！！

482
00:34:45,310 --> 00:34:48,010
Wow, I've never gone this fast before.
以前從沒開這麼快過！！

483
00:34:48,210 --> 00:34:51,480
Phoebe, forget it, okay? Newark is, like, an hour away.
菲比！！算了吧！紐瓦克 一個小時才能到 

484
00:34:51,650 --> 00:34:53,520
There's no way we'll make it in time.
根本趕不上

485
00:34:53,720 --> 00:34:57,520
-She's got her cell. You could call her. -I am not doing this over the phone.
-她拿著手機呢！打電話！ -我不要在電話上談

486
00:34:57,720 --> 00:35:00,620
You don't have any other choice.
你沒其他辦法了啊

487
00:35:06,830 --> 00:35:08,730
-Hello? -Rachel. Oh, good.
-喂? -瑞秋？太好了！ 

488
00:35:08,940 --> 00:35:11,030
By the way, did you just get on the plane?
對了你是不是剛上飛機？

489
00:35:11,240 --> 00:35:13,000
-Yeah. -We would have caught her..
-是啊 -不管怎樣提一句.. 

490
00:35:13,170 --> 00:35:15,700
if we were at the right airport.
如果機場沒去錯

491
00:35:17,710 --> 00:35:21,670
-Rachel, hang on. -No. No. No.
-瑞秋, 等著 -不不不

492
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:23,640
Phoebe, is everything okay?
菲比？你那邊不要緊吧？

493
00:35:26,020 --> 00:35:30,720
Actually, no. No. You have to get off the plane.
啊, 事實上, 有點事情 你必須下飛機

494
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:32,820
-What? Why? -I have this feeling that..
-啊？為什麼？ -我有種感覺 

495
00:35:32,990 --> 00:35:38,690
something's wrong with it. Something is wrong with the left phalange.
飛機有問題, 左「弗蘭基」有毛病

496
00:35:40,670 --> 00:35:43,570
Oh, honey, I'm sure there's nothing wrong with the plane.
親愛的, 飛機肯定沒問題的 

497
00:35:43,740 --> 00:35:49,000
Look, I have to go. I love you, and l will call you the minute I get to Paris.
馬上要起飛了, 我愛你 一到巴黎就打電話 

498
00:35:51,680 --> 00:35:54,740
-What was that? -Oh, that was just my crazy friend.
-你剛才說什麼？ -哦, 我的瘋朋友

499
00:35:54,910 --> 00:35:58,440
She told me to get off the plane because she had a "feeling" that there..
讓我下飛機 因為她就是感覺到

500
00:35:58,620 --> 00:36:02,350
was something wrong with the left phalange.
飛機左「弗蘭基」有毛病

501
00:36:03,090 --> 00:36:06,720
-Okay. That doesn't sound good. -Oh, I wouldn't worry about it.
-聽起來可不妙吧 -不用擔心 

502
00:36:06,890 --> 00:36:09,730
She comes up with this stuff, and she's almost never right.
她老是這樣, 而且幾乎從沒對過 

503
00:36:09,930 --> 00:36:12,560
-But she is sometimes. -Well..
-也就是說她也有對的時候？ -啊...

504
00:36:14,630 --> 00:36:16,970
-What are you doing? -I can't take this plane now.
-你要幹嗎？ -這飛機我不能坐

505
00:36:17,140 --> 00:36:20,470
-Excuse me, sir. Where are you going? -I have to get off this plane.
-對不起, 先生, 您去哪裡？ -我要下飛機 

506
00:36:20,640 --> 00:36:24,870
Her friend has a feeling something's wrong with the left phalange.
她朋友感覺到 飛機左「弗蘭基」有毛病

507
00:36:29,250 --> 00:36:30,910
Could I get some peanuts?
請給我拿點花生好嗎？

508
00:36:32,550 --> 00:36:35,320
-What's wrong with the plane? -There's nothing wrong.
-飛機怎麼了？ -飛機一點異常都沒有

509
00:36:35,520 --> 00:36:38,420
-The left phalange. -There's no "phalange."
-左「弗蘭基」有毛病了 -根本就沒有什麼「弗蘭基」！

510
00:36:38,620 --> 00:36:41,390
Oh, my God. This plane doesn't even have a phalange.
天哪！這破飛機連「弗蘭基」都沒有！

511
00:36:42,930 --> 00:36:44,950
-I'm not flying on it. -Please sit down.
-我不飛了 -女士, 請您坐好

512
00:36:45,160 --> 00:36:49,600
-What's going on? -We're getting off. There is no phalange!
-出什麼事情了？ -我們都下去！飛機上根本就沒有「弗蘭基」！

513
00:36:53,140 --> 00:36:55,660
This is ridiculous. I..
太荒謬了吧, 我   

514
00:36:57,910 --> 00:37:00,440
Yeah, okay.
啊, 隨便吧

515
00:37:08,320 --> 00:37:11,480
All right. My job here is done.
好了, 工作完成

516
00:37:12,090 --> 00:37:15,080
That was impressive.
你太……強了

517
00:37:15,290 --> 00:37:18,820
Yeah. You didn't even use the tools for most of it.
大部分連工具都沒用就弄下來了

518
00:37:19,830 --> 00:37:21,660
Yeah, they were just slowing me down.
啊, 工具太礙事了

519
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:26,840
All right. I gotta get back to the babies. See you girls later.
好啦, 我回去看孩子了 你們倆個丫頭一會兒見 

520
00:37:30,310 --> 00:37:33,610
-Sorry about the table, man. -Yeah.
-真抱歉阿, 桌子這樣了  -嗯

521
00:37:34,180 --> 00:37:35,980
You gonna buy a new one?
要買新的嗎？

522
00:37:36,950 --> 00:37:39,510
Probably not. No.
也許不了……不會了

523
00:37:39,690 --> 00:37:42,810
I don't know how much I'm gonna want to play after you go.
你走後我估計也不怎麼會去玩了

524
00:37:45,990 --> 00:37:49,220
-At least we got these little guys out. -Yeah.
-至少這兩個小傢伙救出來了 -是啊

525
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:51,960
We were worried about you.
我們還擔心你們哪

