I guess I better get used to things crapping in my hand, huh?
以後就多習慣有東西在我手裡拉屎吧

527
00:38:09,350 --> 00:38:11,650
I'm gonna miss these little guys.
我會想你們的, 小傢伙

528
00:38:11,820 --> 00:38:13,720
It was nice having birds around again.
再養養鳥還真挺不錯的

529
00:38:15,490 --> 00:38:19,320
Hey, you know what? Maybe we should keep them here with you.
這樣吧, 它們就交給你了

530
00:38:19,690 --> 00:38:22,350
-What? -Yeah. We got a lot going on right now.
-什麼？ -嗯, 我們現在也忙得要死

531
00:38:22,530 --> 00:38:25,760
And plus, here, they'd have their own room.
而且這裡也有它們的房間啊

532
00:38:26,900 --> 00:38:29,270
I could get a goose!
還可以再養只鵝！

533
00:38:30,770 --> 00:38:34,540
You know, I think you're set with the poultry.
我覺得家禽類這兩隻就夠了

534
00:38:36,710 --> 00:38:38,900
Thanks, man. You hear that, you guys?
多謝了  聽到沒有？ 

535
00:38:39,080 --> 00:38:43,110
You're gonna get to stay here. And it's good..
你們要留在這裡啦！ 而且這樣也挺好的

536
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:45,680
you know, because..
因為  

537
00:38:46,390 --> 00:38:49,080
Because now you have a reason to come visit.
你就有理由多回來看看了

538
00:38:51,890 --> 00:38:55,090
I think there may be another reason.
其實還有一個理由

539
00:39:02,940 --> 00:39:04,730
So..
那個……

540
00:39:06,470 --> 00:39:11,310
Awkward hug or lame cool-guy handshake?
尷尬的擁抱呢…… 還是假酷男握手呢

541
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:15,280
Yeah, well, you know, lame cool-guy handshake.
啊, 還是假酷男握手吧

542
00:39:34,070 --> 00:39:39,470
-Ma'am, I assure you, the plane is fine. -And you fixed the phalange?
-女士, 我想您保證, 飛機沒有問題  -「弗蘭基」也裝好啦？

543
00:39:40,340 --> 00:39:42,470
Yes. The phalange's fixed.
沒錯, 裝好了

544
00:39:42,640 --> 00:39:47,440
In fact, we've put a whole lot of extra phalanges onboard, just in case.
而且 還又帶了一個備用的以防萬一

545
00:39:49,120 --> 00:39:52,140
Paging Mr. Anderson. Mr. Josh Anderson.

546
00:39:52,320 --> 00:39:53,810
-Where is she? -I don't see her.
-她在哪兒？ -看不到

547
00:39:53,990 --> 00:39:56,320
-Rachel! Rachel Green! -There she is!
-瑞秋！！瑞秋.格林！！！ -她在那裡！！

548
00:39:56,520 --> 00:39:59,820
Rachel! Rachel!
瑞秋！！！！！！

549
00:40:00,130 --> 00:40:03,580
-Whoa, do you have a boarding pass? -No. I just have to talk to someone.
-先生, 您有登機牌嗎？ -沒有, 我就是要找裡面的一個人說句話……

550
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:05,530
I'm sorry. You need a boarding pass.
對不起, 沒有登機牌不能再往前走了

551
00:40:05,770 --> 00:40:10,360
-No, no. But you don't.. -Rachel!
-不 不 不…… -瑞秋！！！

552
00:40:11,040 --> 00:40:14,470
What? Oh, my God. What are you guys doing here?
嗯？啊？你們在這裡幹嘛呢？

553
00:40:15,240 --> 00:40:17,330
Okay. You're on.
輪到你了

554
00:40:17,540 --> 00:40:20,770
What? What, Ross? Okay, you're scaring me. What's going on?
怎麼了？怎麼了羅斯？ 你嚇到我了, 出什麼事了？

555
00:40:20,950 --> 00:40:23,880
-Okay. Thing is.. -Yeah.
-嗯  我想說的是... -什麼

556
00:40:24,680 --> 00:40:26,880
-Don't go. -What?
-不要走 -什麼？

557
00:40:27,050 --> 00:40:32,120
Please, please stay with me. I am so in love with you. Please don't go.
留下來和我在一起, 我太愛你了  求求你不要走

558
00:40:33,190 --> 00:40:35,390
-Oh, my God. -I know. I know.
-天哪 -我知道, 我知道

559
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:40,330
I shouldn't have waited till now to say it, but.. That was stupid, okay? I'm sorry.
不應該拖到現在才說的 我太笨了, 對不起 

560
00:40:40,500 --> 00:40:43,400
But I'm telling you now. I love you.
不過我現在和你說：我愛你 

561
00:40:44,500 --> 00:40:49,770
-Do not get on this plane. -Miss, are you boarding the plane?
-不要上飛機 -小姐？您是否要上飛機？

562
00:40:50,140 --> 00:40:51,840
Hey, hey.
嘿 

563
00:40:52,280 --> 00:40:56,680
I know you love me. I know you do.
我知道你愛我, 我都知道

564
00:40:57,220 --> 00:40:58,880
-Miss. -I..
-小姐？ -我……

565
00:40:59,050 --> 00:41:01,380
I.. I have to get on the plane.
我要上飛機

566
00:41:01,850 --> 00:41:03,190
-No, you don't. -Yes, I do.
-不要, 別上飛機 -我要上

567
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:05,980
-No, you don't. -I do. They're waiting for me, Ross.
-不要, 別上飛機 -都等著我呢, 羅斯 

568
00:41:06,160 --> 00:41:09,720
I can't do this right now, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
我現在真的不能這麼做, 對不起 對不起

569
00:41:09,930 --> 00:41:11,830
Rachel.
瑞秋

570
00:41:12,030 --> 00:41:14,360
I'm so sorry.
真的對不起

571
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:30,840
I really thought she'd stay.
我本來以為她會留下的……

572
00:41:31,050 --> 00:41:33,020
I know.
我知道

573
00:41:33,190 --> 00:41:35,310
I'm sorry.
我很遺憾

574
00:41:48,400 --> 00:41:51,630
Well, that's it.
那麼, 就這樣了

575
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:53,330
Everything's packed.
好了, 收拾完畢

576
00:41:57,210 --> 00:41:59,540
-This is weird. -I know.
-啊, 感覺有點怪啊 -我明白

577
00:41:59,710 --> 00:42:01,040
Yeah.
嗯

578
00:42:02,410 --> 00:42:04,610
Does this mean there's nothing to eat?
啊……也就是說沒吃的了？

579
00:42:06,220 --> 00:42:08,280
I put three lasagnas in your freezer.
我在你冰箱裡面放了三盤意大利寬麵條

580
00:42:09,920 --> 00:42:12,220
I love you.
我愛你

581
00:42:15,060 --> 00:42:17,720
-Hey. -Hey. Did you guys make it in time?
-嘿 -怎樣？趕上了嗎？

582
00:42:17,900 --> 00:42:22,100
Yeah, yeah. He talked to her, but she got on the plane anyway.
趕上了, 他跟她說了 不過她最後還是上了飛機

583
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:25,960
Where's Ross?
羅斯呢？

584
00:42:26,170 --> 00:42:28,370
He went home. He didn't want to see anybody.
回家了, 他誰也不想見

585
00:42:46,160 --> 00:42:50,150
Ross. Hi, it's me.
「羅斯, 嗨 是我」

586
00:42:50,400 --> 00:42:55,130
I just got back on the plane, and I just feel awful.
「我剛回到飛機上」 「我現在感覺太難受了」

587
00:42:55,470 --> 00:42:59,770
That is so not how I wanted things to end with us.
「我絕不希望我們之間這麼就完了」

588
00:43:00,940 --> 00:43:03,930
It's just that I wasn't expecting to see you.
「只是……只是我根本沒料到你會出現」

589
00:43:04,110 --> 00:43:07,670
And all of a sudden you're there and saying these things.
「猛一下子你就來了, 還說那些話……」

590
00:43:09,050 --> 00:43:12,040
Now I'm just sitting here and thinking..
「我現在坐在這裡, 靜靜地想……」

591
00:43:12,220 --> 00:43:15,980
of all the stuff I should have said and I didn't.
「想我應該說卻沒有說出口的話」

592
00:43:16,220 --> 00:43:20,020
I mean, I didn't even get to tell you that I love you too.
「我甚至都沒跟你說我也愛你」

593
00:43:20,930 --> 00:43:24,190
Because of course I do. I love you.
「因為, 我真的愛你」

594
00:43:26,230 --> 00:43:28,170
I love you.
「我愛你」

595
00:43:28,870 --> 00:43:30,800
I love you.
「我愛你」

596
00:43:31,300 --> 00:43:35,670
What am I doing? I love you.
「我到底在幹什麼？我愛你！」

597
00:43:37,810 --> 00:43:40,840
I've got to see you. I've got to get off this plane.
「我要見你, 我要下飛機！」

598
00:43:41,010 --> 00:43:42,740
Oh, my God.
天哪

599
00:43:42,950 --> 00:43:45,970
-Okay, excuse me. -Miss, please sit down.
-「打擾一下！」 -「小姐, 請坐下」

600
00:43:46,150 --> 00:43:49,310
No, I'm sorry. I'm really sorry, but I need to get off the plane.
「真對不起, 我要立刻下飛機！

601
00:43:49,490 --> 00:43:52,550
-I need to tell someone that I love them. -I can't let you off.
-去告訴他我愛他！」 -「小姐, 現在不能下飛機」

602
00:43:52,730 --> 00:43:55,660
Let her off the plane!
讓她下飛機！！！！！

603
00:43:56,460 --> 00:43:58,160
You have to take your seat.
「請您務必坐好」

604
00:43:58,330 --> 00:44:00,820
Oh, please, miss. You don't understand.
「求求你了, 你不明白！」

605
00:44:01,030 --> 00:44:03,560
Try to understand!
你不明白！！！！！！

606
00:44:03,770 --> 00:44:07,870
Come on, miss, isn't there any way that you can just let me off the..?
「小姐, 有沒有辦法讓我能下……」

607
00:44:08,070 --> 00:44:09,900
No! No!
不要！！！！！！！！！

608
00:44:10,410 --> 00:44:15,110
Oh, my God. Did she get off the plane? Did she get off the plane?
上帝啊, 到底下沒下飛機？到底下沒下飛機？！

609
00:44:16,520 --> 00:44:19,210
I got off the plane.
我下飛機了……

610
00:44:29,290 --> 00:44:31,130
You got off the plane.
你下飛機了……

611
00:44:43,440 --> 00:44:46,040
I do love you.
我愛你, 真的

612
00:44:46,250 --> 00:44:48,810
I love you too, and I am never letting you go again.
我也愛你, 再也不會讓你走了

613
00:44:49,010 --> 00:44:52,310
Okay. Because this is where I want to be. No more messing around.
我也希望留在這裡, 再也不要有遺憾

614
00:44:52,520 --> 00:44:56,650
-I don't want to mess this up again. -Me neither. We're done being stupid.
-我不想再搞砸了 -我也不想, 我們已經蠢過一次了

615
00:44:56,820 --> 00:44:59,450
Okay. It's you and me, all right? This is it.
只有你和我, 好不好,  只有你和我

616
00:44:59,630 --> 00:45:03,290
This is it. Unless we're on a break.
只有你和我 除非我們是在分手中……

617
00:45:13,070 --> 00:45:14,770
Don't make jokes now.
現在可不是開玩笑的時候

618
00:45:35,260 --> 00:45:38,860
Okay, please be careful with that. It was my grandmother's. Be careful.
請小心點, 這是我祖母的,  請務必小心

619
00:45:39,060 --> 00:45:40,620
Thank you.
多謝

620
00:45:40,830 --> 00:45:44,200
If that falls off the truck, it wouldn't be the worst thing.
如果這玩意兒掉下去了, 也沒什麼大不了的

621
00:45:56,120 --> 00:45:57,810
I know.
是啊

622
00:45:58,020 --> 00:46:00,710
Seems smaller somehow.
看起來好像小了一圈

623
00:46:02,150 --> 00:46:05,610
Has it always been purple?
一直都是紫色的？！

624
00:46:08,160 --> 00:46:12,320
Look around, you guys. This was your first home.
小傢伙們, 看看四周吧 這裡是你們第一個家

625
00:46:13,600 --> 00:46:19,630
And it was a happy place, filled with love and laughter.
一個幸福的家 充滿了愛心與歡笑

626
00:46:19,810 --> 00:46:24,610
But more important, because of rent control, it was a frigging steal.
更重要的是 租金管制簡直就是明搶啊

627
00:46:28,350 --> 00:46:33,480
Hey, do you realize that, at one time or another, we all lived in this apartment?
嗨, 你們有沒有意識到, 我們每個人都在這裡住過

628
00:46:34,050 --> 00:46:35,820
Oh, yeah. That's true.
還真是

629
00:46:36,560 --> 00:46:38,390
I haven't.
我沒有

630
00:46:39,490 --> 00:46:42,760
What about that summer during college that you lived with Grandma..
你大學有一年暑假過來和祖母住

631
00:46:42,930 --> 00:46:45,690
and you tried to make it as a dancer?
然後你想靠跳舞來掙錢……

632
00:46:50,440 --> 00:46:54,390
Do you realize we almost made it 10 years without that coming up?
你有沒有意識到, 這都是十年前的骨灰了你還往外挖？

633
00:46:58,340 --> 00:47:01,780
Oh, honey, I forgot. I promised Treeger that we'd leave our keys.
啊, 親愛的, 我差點忘了  我答應崔格把鑰匙留下

634
00:47:01,950 --> 00:47:04,180
Oh, okay.
好

635
00:47:38,220 --> 00:47:41,580
-So I guess this is it. -Yeah.
-都結束了？ -是啊

636
00:47:43,090 --> 00:47:44,560
I guess so.
應該是吧

637
00:47:46,690 --> 00:47:49,090
This is harder than I thought it would be.
比想像中的還要難啊！

638
00:47:49,260 --> 00:47:51,790
Oh, it's gonna be okay.
會好的

639
00:47:54,430 --> 00:47:56,060
Come on.
好了

640
00:48:02,810 --> 00:48:07,510
Do you guys have to go to the new house now, or do you have some time?
你們倆是馬上去新房子還是能擠出點時間來嗎？

641
00:48:10,220 --> 00:48:11,580
We got some time.
還有點時間

642
00:48:12,220 --> 00:48:16,150
-Okay. Should we get some coffee? -Sure.
-去喝杯咖啡怎麼樣？ -好啊 

643
00:48:17,260 --> 00:48:18,920
Where?
去哪兒喝？

644
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


645
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


